{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41610","headline":"暮冬送何秀才毘陵 · 伍乔","name":"暮冬送何秀才毘陵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"匹马嘶风去思长，素琴孤劒称戎装。\n路涂多是过残岁，杯酒无辞到醉乡。\n云傍水村凝冷片，雪连山驿积寒光。\n毘陵城下饶嘉景，回日新诗应满堂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"伍乔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41610.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41610","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}